cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use IonTrace in work you publish, please cite it as below."
title: "IonTrace: open source ion trajectory simulation in the browser"
abstract: >-
  IonTrace simulates charged-particle trajectories through electrostatic ion
  optics - einzel lenses, quadrupoles, benders and full columns - in the
  browser, with no build step and no runtime dependencies.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Navarro
    given-names: Paco
repository-code: "https://github.com/Craftyleosteel/IonTrace"
url: "https://github.com/Craftyleosteel/IonTrace"
license: MIT
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-23"
keywords:
  - ion optics
  - charged particle optics
  - trajectory simulation
  - electrostatics
  - space charge
  - physics
